      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "Monetary policy seeks to buffer the economy from unexpected adverse disruptions, or \"shocks.\""
    },
    {
      "event_type": "monetary_fiscal",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "It is generally more challenging for monetary policy to insulate the economy from shocks to the supply side of the economy than to the demand side."
    },
    {
      "event_type": "macro_economy",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "As the frequency of heat waves increases, research indicates there could be important effects on output and labor productivity."
    },
    {
      "event_type": "industry_supply_demand",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "A shifting energy landscape, rising insurance premiums, and increasing spending on climate change adaptations—such as air conditioning and elevating homes out of floodplains—will"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "unknown",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "feedback loops could develop between the effects on the real economy and those on financial markets"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "risk_incident",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "a sudden correction could result in losses to financial institutions"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "unknown",
      "subject": null,
      "action": null,
      "object": null,
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "policymakers in some jurisdictions are assessing the resilience of the financial system to so-called transition risks"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "industry_supply_demand",
      "subject": null,
      "action": "exposed to",
      "object": "risk",
      "key_period": null,
      "key_values": null,
      "conditions": null,
      "evidence_type": "explicit",
      "quote": "Based on these disclosures, the CDP estimates that the 500 largest companies by market capitalization are exposed to nearly $1 trillion in risk"
